                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Knight Squad, where do i even begin...\r\n\r\nI saw this game on sale the other day for about 3 dollars and decided to buy it on a whim, I was depressed, anxious, single and working at a crappy job that i hated, i had no will to live and didn't think id make it to the next year. Since then my life has been changed for the better forever, my eyes have been opened to the wonders this world has to offer. Ever since i booted up Knight Squad for the first time i've gained new friends, a job making 6 figures and a beautiful wife i am madly in love with, and we are now expecting a child in a few months in our mansion and its all thanks to Knight Squad, let that sink in. I've traveled the world 14 times over, making good connections with people from nearly any country you can name, I think back to Knight Squad almost daily, i wish i didnt buy it for only 3 dollars, it should have costed me 100, no 1000 dollars, thats what Knight Squad deserves for allowing me to see the true meaning of life.\r\n\r\nShooter, Skills, Selfie, Slayer, Shadow, Sparkles, Shiny, Sinister, Smoke, Spike, Savior, Solo, Shockwave, Storm, Smash and of course, Salmon. These are the Knights that changed my life, i know they smile down upon me daily, and i smile back. Theres no way i could ever repay those Knights for how much they helped me, all i can do is dedicate every moment of my life to them... \r\n\r\nbuy Knight Squad, play it, it changed my life, it will change yours too. I promise.",
